# --- Fully ignore Vivado-generated directories (no matter where they are) ---
**/*.cache/
**/*.runs/
**/*.sim/
**/*.hw/
**/*.gen/
**/*.ip_user_files/
**/*.srcs/
**/.Xil/
*.xpr

# --- Whitelist: ignore everything else except .v, .xdc, and video files ---
*
!*/
!*.md
!*.v
!*.xdc
!*.mp4
!*.mov
!*.avi
!*.mkv
!.gitignore
!flatten_for_git.ps1